<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="cs" class="dark">
<head>
 <meta charset="UTF-8">
 <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
 <title>Asistent manuálního střihu podcastu (v5.1)</title>
 <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
 <script>
 tailwind.config = { darkMode: 'class', theme: { extend: { colors: { studio: { bg: '#0F172A', panel: '#1E293B', border: '#334155', cut: '#F59E0B', jingle: '#10B981', note: '#8B5CF6', accent: '#06B6D4', speech: '#3B82F6' } } } } }
 </script>
 <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
 <style>
 body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #0F172A; color: #F8FAFC; }
 ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; }
 ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #1E293B; }
 ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #475569; border-radius: 4px; }
 ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #64748B; }
 .highlight-active-row { background-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15) !important; border-left: 4px solid #06B6D4; }
 </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between">
 <div id="toast" class="fixed bottom-5 right-5 z-50 transform translate-y-20 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 bg-studio-accent text-slate-950 font-semibold px-4 py-3 rounded-lg shadow-xl flex items-center gap-2 pointer-events-none">
 <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
 <span id="toast-message">Zpráva...</span>
 </div>

 <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full p-4 md:p-6 space-y-6 flex-grow">
 <header class="bg-studio-panel border border-studio-border rounded-xl p-5 shadow-xl">
 <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-4 mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-studio-border">
 <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
 <div class="p-3 bg-studio-accent/10 border border-studio-accent/30 rounded-xl text-studio-accent">
 <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11a7 7 0 01-7 7m0 0a7 7 0 01-7-7m7 7v4m0 0H8m4 0h4m-4-8a3 3 0 01-3-3V5a3 3 0 116 0v6a3 3 0 01-3 3z"></path></svg>
 </div>
 <div>
 <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
 <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">Asistent manuálního střihu podcastu</h1>
 <span class="bg-studio-accent/20 text-studio-accent border border-studio-accent/40 font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs shadow-sm">v5.1</span>
 </div>
 <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Manuální střih, lokální AI přepis mluveného slova a podklad pro zvukaře / REAPER</p>
 </div>
 </div>

 <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
 <button onclick="toggleShortcutsModal()" class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
 <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-studio-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4"></path></svg> Klávesové zkratky
 </button>
 <button onclick="saveProjectJSON()" class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-slate-200 hover:text-white bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg transition flex items-center gap-1.5" title="Uložit projekt do .json">
 <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v9a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-3m-1 4l-3 3m0 0l-3-3m3 3V4"></path></svg> Uložit JSON
 </button>
 <label class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-slate-200 hover:text-white bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg transition flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer" title="Načíst projekt z .json">
 <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-8l-4-4m0 0l-4 4m4-4v12"></path></svg> Načíst JSON
 <input type="file" id="json-file-input" accept=".json" class="hidden" onchange="loadProjectJSON(event)">
 </label>
 <button onclick="resetProjectData()" class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-rose-400 hover:text-rose-300 bg-rose-950/40 hover:bg-rose-900/60 border border-rose-800/50 rounded-lg transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
 <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 7l-.867 12.142A2 2 0 0116.138 21H7.862a2 2 0 01-1.995-1.858L5 7m5 4v6m4-6v6m1-10V4a1 1 0 00-1-1h-4a1 1 0 00-1 1v3M4 7h16"></path></svg> Nové zadání
 </button>
 </div>
 </div>

 <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
 <div>
 <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 mb-1">Název epizody / projektu</label>
 <input type="text" id="meta-title" placeholder="Např. EP#42 - Rozhovor s hostem" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-studio-accent focus:outline-none" oninput="saveMetadata()">
 </div>
 <div>
 <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 mb-1">Autor / Střihač</label>
 <input type="text" id="meta-author" placeholder="Jméno střihače" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-studio-accent focus:outline-none" oninput="saveMetadata()">
 </div>
 <div>
 <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 mb-1">Celková poznámka k epizodě</label>
 <input type="text" id="meta-notes" placeholder="Např. Masterovat na -16 LUFS, vyčistit šum" class="w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-studio-accent focus:outline-none" oninput="saveMetadata()">
 </div>
 </div>
 </header>

 <section class="bg-studio-panel border border-studio-border rounded-xl p-5 shadow-xl space-y-4">
 <div id="upload-zone" class="border-2 border-dashed border-slate-700 hover:border-studio-accent rounded-xl p-8 text-center bg-slate-900/50 hover:bg-slate-900/80 transition cursor-pointer relative" onclick="document.getElementById('audio-file-input').click()">
 <input type="file" id="audio-file-input" accept="audio/*" class="hidden" onchange="handleFileSelect(event)">
 <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2">
 <div class="p-4 bg-slate-800 rounded-full text-studio-accent">
 <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 16a4 4 0 01-.88-7.903A5 5 0 1115.9 6L16 6a5 5 0 011 9.9M15 13l-3-3m0 0l-3 3m3-3v12"></path></svg>
 </div>
 <p class="font-semibold text-white">Klikněte nebo přetáhněte audio soubor sem</p>
 <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Podporuje MP3, WAV, M4A, OGG (lokální zpracování)</p>
 </div>
 </div>

 <div id="player-container" class="hidden space-y-4">
 <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs text-slate-400 px-1">
 <span id="audio-file-name" class="font-medium text-slate-200 truncate max-w-md">Soubor...</span>
 <span id="audio-status" class="text-studio-accent font-semibold">Načteno</span>
 </div>

 <div class="relative bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg p-2 overflow-hidden select-none">
 <canvas id="waveform-canvas" class="w-full h-28 cursor-pointer block"></canvas>
 <div id="canvas-loading" class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-950/80 flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-studio-accent font-medium hidden">Dekódování zvukové vlny...</div>
 </div>

 <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg p-3">
 <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
 <button onclick="seekRelative(-3)" class="p-2 text-slate-300 hover:text-white bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 rounded-lg transition text-xs font-semibold" title="Zpět 3s">-3s</button>
 <button id="btn-play" onclick="togglePlay()" class="p-3 bg-studio-accent hover:bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950 rounded-lg font-bold transition flex items-center justify-center">
 <svg id="icon-play" class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
 <svg id="icon-pause" class="w-6 h-6 hidden" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 19h4V5H6v14zm8-14v14h4V5h-4z"/></svg>
 </button>
 <button onclick="seekRelative(3)" class="p-2 text-slate-300 hover:text-white bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 rounded-lg transition text-xs font-semibold" title="Vpřed 3s">+3s</button>
 </div>

 <div class="font-mono text-lg font-semibold tracking-wider text-white">
 <span id="time-current" class="text-studio-accent">00:00:00</span> / <span id="time-total" class="text-slate-400">00:00:00</span>
 </div>

 <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400">
 <span>Rychlost:</span>
 <select id="speed-select" onchange="changeSpeed(this.value)" class="bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 rounded px-2 py-1 focus:outline-none focus:border-studio-accent">
 <option value="0.5">0.5x</option><option value="0.75">0.75x</option><option value="1.0" selected>1.0x</option><option value="1.25">1.25x</option><option value="1.5">1.5x</option><option value="2.0">2.0x</option>
 </select>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 <audio id="audio-player"></audio>
 </section>

 <section class="bg-studio-panel border border-studio-border rounded-xl p-5 shadow-xl space-y-4">
 <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2">
 <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-studio-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0H9m12 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg> Manuální vložení značky
 </h2>

 <div id="cut-pending-banner" class="hidden bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/40 rounded-lg p-3 flex items-center justify-between">
 <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-400 text-xs font-semibold">
 <span class="animate-pulse inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span> Začátek střihu označen v: <span id="pending-in-time" class="font-mono text-sm underline">00:00:00</span>
 </div>
 <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
 <button onclick="confirmCut()" class="px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-bold text-xs rounded transition">Označit Konec a Vložit Střih [C]</button>
 <button onclick="cancelPendingCut()" class="px-2 py-1 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 text-xs">Zrušit</button>
 </div>
 </div>

 <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
 <button onclick="handleCutButtonClick()" class="p-3 bg-amber-950/30 hover:bg-amber-900/50 border border-amber-600/40 rounded-xl transition text-left group">
 <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
 <span class="font-bold text-amber-400 group-hover:text-amber-300 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14.121 14.121L19 19m-7-7l7-7m-7 7l-2.879 2.879M12 12L9.121 9.121m0 0L4 4m5 5l-5 5"></path></svg> Střih / Highlight</span>
 <span class="text-[10px] bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Klávesa C</span>
 </div>
 <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Označí začátek (In) a konec (Out) střihu nebo highlightu.</p>
 </button>

 <button onclick="openJingleModal()" class="p-3 bg-emerald-950/30 hover:bg-emerald-900/50 border border-emerald-600/40 rounded-xl transition text-left group">
 <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
 <span class="font-bold text-emerald-400 group-hover:text-emerald-300 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19V6l12-2v13M9 19c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zm12 0c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 3 .895 3 2zM9 10l12-2"></path></svg> Vlož soubor</span>
 <span class="text-[10px] bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Klávesa Y</span>
 </div>
 <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Intro/Outro znělka, přechodový efekt, reklamní blok.</p>
 </button>

 <button onclick="openNoteModal()" class="p-3 bg-purple-950/30 hover:bg-purple-900/50 border border-purple-600/40 rounded-xl transition text-left group">
 <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
 <span class="font-bold text-purple-400 group-hover:text-purple-300 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 8h10M7 12h4m1 8l-4-4H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 v8a2 2 0 01-2 2h-3l-4 4z"></path></svg> Poznámka</span>
 <span class="text-[10px] bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Klávesa M</span>
 </div>
 <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Instrukce zvukaři (šum, hlasitost, odkašlání).</p>
 </button>
 </div>
 </section>

 <section class="bg-slate-900/90 border border-studio-accent/30 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-xl space-y-4">
 <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between items-start lg:items-center gap-4">
 <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
 <div class="p-2.5 bg-studio-accent/20 text-studio-accent rounded-lg">
 <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
 </div>
 <div>
 <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">Integrovaný AI přepis mluveného slova</h2>
 <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Spusťte přepis přímo v prohlížeči. Vybraná slova se spárují s vašimi střihy.</p>
 </div>
 </div>

 <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 w-full lg:w-auto">
 <select id="ai-model-select" onchange="updateAiEstimate()" class="bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs focus:outline-none focus:border-studio-accent">
 <option value="Xenova/whisper-tiny">Whisper Tiny (~39 MB)</option>
 <option value="Xenova/whisper-base">Whisper Base (~73 MB)</option>
 <option value="Xenova/whisper-small" selected>Whisper Small (~240 MB)</option>
 </select>

 <select id="ai-device-select" onchange="updateAiEstimate()" class="bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 border border-studio-accent/50 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs focus:outline-none focus:border-studio-accent font-semibold text-cyan-300">
 <option value="auto" selected>⚡ Bleskový (WebGPU)</option>
 <option value="wasm">⚖️ Standardní (CPU)</option>
 </select>

 <button id="btn-start-ai" onclick="runAiTranscription()" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 bg-studio-accent hover:bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950 font-bold text-xs rounded-lg transition flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow">
 <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14.752 11.168l-3.197-2.132A1 1 0 0010 9.87v4.263a1 1 0 001.555.832l3.197-2.132a1 1 0 000-1.664z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg> Spustit AI přepis
 </button>
 </div>
 </div>

 <div id="ai-estimate-box" class="bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg px-3.5 py-2.5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between text-xs gap-2">
 <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-300">
 <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-studio-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
 <span>Odhadovaná doba generování: <strong id="est-duration-text" class="text-amber-400 font-semibold">Vyžaduje načtené audio</strong></span>
 </div>
 <div id="est-finish-text" class="font-bold text-emerald-400 font-mono text-xs">Hotovo: —</div>
 </div>

 <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-800/80">
 <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 mb-1">Vlastní slovník / Nápověda pro AI (Initial Prompt - volitelné)</label>
 <input type="text" id="ai-prompt-input" placeholder="" class="w-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-studio-accent">
 <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1">Zadejte neobvyklá jména, slang nebo speciální pojmy.</p>
 </div>

 <div id="ai-progress-container" class="hidden space-y-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800">
 <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
 <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
 <span class="relative flex h-2.5 w-2.5">
 <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-studio-accent opacity-75"></span>
 <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-studio-accent"></span>
 </span>
 <span id="ai-status-text" class="text-slate-300 font-medium">Příprava výpočtu na pozadí...</span>
 </div>
 <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
 <span class="text-slate-400 font-mono flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-slate-950/50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-slate-800" title="Uplynulý čas výpočtu">
 <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-studio-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
 <span id="ai-timer" class="text-slate-200">00:00</span>
 </span>
 <span id="ai-status-percent" class="text-studio-accent font-mono font-bold">0%</span>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div class="w-full bg-slate-800 h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
 <div id="ai-progress-bar" class="bg-studio-accent h-full w-0 transition-all duration-200"></div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </section>

 <section class="bg-studio-panel border border-studio-border rounded-xl p-5 shadow-xl space-y-4">
 <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between items-start lg:items-center gap-4">
 <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
 <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-studio-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2"></path></svg> Střihový protokol pro zvukaře (<span id="items-count">0</span>)
 </h2>

 <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 w-full lg:w-auto">
 <div class="relative flex-grow lg:flex-grow-0">
 <input type="text" id="search-input" oninput="handleSearch(this.value)" placeholder="Hledat..." class="w-full lg:w-64 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg pl-8 pr-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-studio-accent">
 <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-500 absolute left-2.5 top-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"></path></svg>
 </div>

 <div class="flex items-center gap-1 bg-slate-900 p-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 text-xs">
 <button onclick="setFilter('all')" id="filter-all" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium transition bg-slate-800 text-white">Vše</button>
 <button onclick="setFilter('cut')" id="filter-cut" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium transition text-slate-400 hover:text-white">Střihy</button>
 <button onclick="setFilter('jingle')" id="filter-jingle" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium transition text-slate-400 hover:text-white">Znělky</button>
 <button onclick="setFilter('note')" id="filter-note" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium transition text-slate-400 hover:text-white">Poznámky</button>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>

